  "title": "Juicy Romantic Middle Eastern Petit Pois Stir-fry",
  "description": "A vibrant and aromatic citrusy vegetarian dish featuring petit pois with a medley of aromatic herbs and spices to create a romantic and delightful meal for two.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
